{"id":"ce002","name":"Hacking Game (CE002)","folder":"ce002","intro":{"id":"d_contents_ce002_mini_01","label":"Suspicious Device"},"help":[],"tables":[{"name":"Manager","rows":2},{"name":"Tutorial","rows":4},{"name":"Archive","rows":46},{"name":"Data","rows":46},{"name":"Monster","rows":37},{"name":"NPC","rows":46},{"name":"Stage","rows":46},{"name":"WaveData","rows":2054}],"view":{"summary":"Find each hacking target on the event field, then win a short top-down shooter stage by destroying the target once its guards are gone.","overview":[{"type":"facts","title":"How it works","items":[["Orders","Accept one hacking data order at a time; orders unlock in sequence over the event."],["Finding the target","The order gives a location hint; walk there on the event field and press Hacking."],["Controls","Touch and drag to move. Your unit fires on its own, at nearby enemies or in the direction it moves."],["Winning","Destroy the target. While any other enemy is alive, the target has a shield."],["Losing","Getting hit 3 times (300 HP, 100 damage per enemy bullet) or running out of time."],["After clearing","The stage can be replayed, and its archive entry can be read from the menu."],["Intro story",{"scene":"d_contents_ce002_mini_01","label":"Suspicious Device"}]]},{"type":"table","title":"Enemy types","columns":["Type","What it does"],"rows":[[{"tag":"Target","tone":"accent"},"The hacking target. Killing it clears the stage; it is shielded while other enemies remain."],[{"tag":"Fixed","tone":"bad"},"A turret that stays in place and shoots."],[{"tag":"Mobile","tone":"bad"},"Moves around and chases you; some shoot."],[{"tag":"Breakable wall"},"A block that can be shot apart."],[{"tag":"Wall"},"An indestructible obstacle (comes in many shapes)."]]},{"type":"gallery","title":"Target locations","items":[{"img":"ce002_minigame_npc_01","caption":"HACKING DATA #001"},{"img":"ce002_minigame_npc_14","caption":"HACKING DATA #002"},{"img":"ce002_minigame_npc_23","caption":"HACKING DATA